  "supportedTakeaway": "The normalized half-strain envelope is exactly exp(-4t)+exp(-16t), its cumulative integral saturates at 5/16, and j*=0.001108032448... lies strictly above 359/324000 and the inherited R0.73M action upper bound. The marked-basepoint curves illustrate exponential nonuniformity across Lambda; they are not the sharp flow-map modulus and do not certify arbitrary fixed-background instability.",
